CONFIRMED H1b [identity] for each orbit vector, 4 ipW(e_s, prodState x y) = 1 + x^T M_s y with M_s = 4 e_s[1:,1:] a signed permutation, and 2(1 + x^T M_s y) = |x + M_s y|^2 + (1-|x|^2) + (1-|y|^2), symbolic (run 1 had the sign of M_s reversed: harness)
CONFIRMED H1c [identity] pauliW(prodState x y) = rho(x) (x) rho(y): products are in Q3; with H1a/H1b they lie in Q3 cap Z*, hence in K(Z)

